t;0&lt;br&gt;Authoritative real-time server for Dice Chess — human-vs-human play, the doubling cube, and a third-party Bot API. Phase 3: Scala 3, cats-effect, http4s, WebSocket, reusing the dice-chess engine on the JVM.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/rabestro/paperless-genie&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;paperless-genie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;8 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;🧞 AI-powered Telegram bot for Paperless-ngx — chat with your document archive, upload and process documents, set metadata, and search — all from Telegram.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Hi there, I&#39;m Jegors! 👋&lt;/h1&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;Scala Maintainer | Open Source Mentor | Game Engine Architect&lt;/h3&gt; 
